{
    "id": "rover_reports_to_lily",
    "title": "Rover Reports Back to Lily",
    "settings": {
    "background": null,
    "bgm": null,
    "autoPlay": false
    },
    "lines": [
    {
    "id": "line_001",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 3,
    "text": "Rover! You're back."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_002",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "We received word from the northern village. They said you helped hold back the monster attack."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_003",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "Only the first wave. The danger hasn't passed."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_004",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 2,
    "text": "The monsters are still gathering, and the mana disturbance remains."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_005",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 2,
    "text": "I was afraid you'd say that."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_006",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "Still, what you've done has given the villagers hope."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_007",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "I've seen how you fight, Rover. More importantly, I've seen how willing you are to help strangers."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_008",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 2,
    "text": "So I'd like to ask something of you."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_009",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_010",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 2,
    "text": "Will you help protect our villages until we discover what's causing all of this?"
    },
    {
    "id": "line_011",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "I won't ask you to carry the burden alone."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_012",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "The villagers will continue to stand and fight beside you."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_013",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 2,
    "text": "But we need someone capable of leading the effort."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_014",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 2,
    "text": "...You place a lot of trust in someone you barely know."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_015",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_016",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "But you've already proven more trustworthy than many people I've known for years."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_017",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "..."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_018",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_019",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "I'll help protect the villages and find the source of these disturbances."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_020",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 3,
    "text": "Thank you, Rover."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_021",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lily",
    "emo": 1,
    "text": "Then let's prepare for whatever comes next."
    }
    ]
    }
